---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHead from "../components/PageHead.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---

<Base
  title="About Mohammadreza Norouzi | Medical Background and Biography"
  description="Read about Mohammadreza Norouzi’s medical education in Iran, prior general practice, healthcare management training, and current research interests in Vancouver."
  label="About"
  type="ProfilePage"
>
  <PageHead
    title="Beyond the Practice of Medicine"
    description="Driven by curiosity. Inspired by people. Focused on change."
  />
  <div class="wrap section editorial">
    <aside class="aside-card">
      <Icon name="pin" size={26} />
      <h2>Based in Vancouver</h2>
      <p>British Columbia, Canada</p>
      <a class="textlink" href="/cv/">
        Curriculum vitae <Icon name="arrow" size={16} />
      </a>
    </aside>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Professional biography</h2>
      <p class="lead">{profile.bio}</p>
      <h2>Clinical practice and community health</h2>
      <p>As I moved from medical education into clinical practice, that curiosity developed into a broader sense of purpose. Practising medicine in underserved communities exposed me to the profound differences in health and well-being that can exist within the same society. I saw how access to healthcare, available resources, and socioeconomic circumstances can shape people's opportunities to live healthier lives.</p>
      <p>These experiences changed the way I think about medicine. I came to see that improving health requires more than treating individual patients. It also means questioning how healthcare is organised, identifying gaps in access, and exploring solutions that can benefit entire communities.</p>
      <h2>Medicine, Research, and Innovation</h2>
      <p>Today, my interests bring together three interconnected fields: Medicine, Research, and Innovation. My clinical background provides a practical foundation, scientific inquiry helps me approach complex problems critically, and my education in healthcare management has expanded my perspective on how meaningful change can be achieved. Looking ahead, I aspire to build a healthcare startup that addresses real-world challenges and helps make timely, high-quality healthcare more accessible, regardless of people's financial circumstances.</p>
      <div class="note">{profile.disclosure}</div>
      <a class="textlink" href="/experience/">
        Explore my education and experience <Icon name="arrow" size={17} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
